# Models

All models are also published as a STAC catalog: [catalog]({{ stac_catalog_url }}) · [model collection]({{ stac_collection_url }}).

<div class="model-grid">
    {% for model in models %}
        <a class="model-card-link" href="./{{ model.slug }}/">
        <div class="model-card">
        <h3 class="model-card-title">{{ model.name }}</h3>
        {% if model.description %}
            <p class="model-card-description">{{ model.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if model.tags %}
            <p class="model-card-badges">{% for tag in model.tags %}<Badge text="{{ tag }}" type="info" /> {% endfor %}</p>
        {% endif %}
        </div>
        </a>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
